# The Craft | EXT | Canoe, Navigator's Platform | NIGHT | tane, maui_iti, hina | Show the path | {tane} names each star as it rises and has his son repeat it. {hina}, below, says them a breath ahead | | 6 | water, vehicles=voyaging canoe, vfx=night sky and star compass
# The Craft | EXT | Canoe, Steering Paddle | NIGHT | tane, maui_iti, rangi | Go blind | {tane} asks which star is over the bow. It is in front of him. {rangi} gives the paddle to the heir | {tane} cannot see | 5 | water, vehicles=voyaging canoe
# Lost | EXT | Canoe, Open Sea | DAWN | maui_iti, rangi, hina | Lose the swell | Crossed seas all night. By dawn {maui_iti} cannot say where they are. Nobody speaks | The canoe is lost | 5 | water, crowd=60, vehicles=voyaging canoe, vfx=crossed swells
# Lost | INT | Canoe, Inside The Hull | DAY | hina, tane | Find it | {hina} lies in the hull with her eyes shut. Her father, beside her, says nothing. She says: there. There is the old one, under the others | {hina} finds the path | 6 | water
# Authority | EXT | Canoe, Navigator's Platform | NIGHT | hina, tane, rangi, maui_iti | Steer against him | {tane} says hold. She turns two houses of the compass. A storm passes where they would have been. {rangi} asks her, not him, where to steer | | 7 | water, crowd=60, vehicles=voyaging canoe, stunts=storm steering, vfx=storm at sea
# Landfall | EXT | Canoe, Bow | DAY | hina, rangi, maui_iti | Read the cloud | A branch with red berries. A cloud that is long, white and does not move. Four days more | Land is found | 5 | water, vehicles=voyaging canoe, vfx=long white cloud on horizon
# Landfall | EXT | Cold Shore | NIGHT | hina, tane, rangi | Tell him the sky | Fires on a strange beach. {tane} asks what the stars are doing here. She tells him which have changed | | 4 | crowd=60, vfx=southern night sky
review: authored | 2026-11-12 | written whole; drawn from Polynesian voyaging and the settlement of Aotearoa, with invented people
